From: emscripten-forge
Subject: [PATCH] Calls through function pointers with the callee's own type

WebAssembly checks the type of every indirect call, where native calling
conventions let a caller pass more arguments, or expect a result the
callee does not return. scicos calls the computational functions of
types 0, 1 and 10001 with as many arguments as they take (it passes all 50
otherwise); the DCDFLIB routines, the ode/odedc/feval example functions and
the GUI console's output function are called with their types.
